"Reports say there seems to be a significant increase of pirate activity in "
"the {sys} system. Local authorities request civilians to avoid the system "
"until the increased hostilities cease, which are expected to continue until "
"{date}."
msgstr ""

msgid "Pirates have stopped raiding {sys}."
msgstr ""

