msgstr "\"황제께서 착륙을 허가하셨습니다.\""

msgid "\"You may not approach the Emperor.\""
msgstr "\"황제에게 접근할 수 없습니다.\""

msgid "\"Don't attempt to bribe an Empire official, pilot.\""
